# The whole game is one 3,100-line index.html. Every file in the project is LF,
# and it is pinned that way on purpose: if a Windows editor were allowed to
# write CRLF, a one-line change would show up as a whole-file diff and the
# history would stop being readable.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored three.js r128. Never hand-edit it, and keep it out of diffs — a
# 603KB minified blob rewritten by a normalization pass would bury every real
# change in the commit that touched it.
three.min.js linguist-vendored -diff
